Scope

This licence covers the source code in this repository (src/, data/*.cfg,
traduction.cfg, distrib/, tools/, third_party/*.ps1) EXCEPT the third-party
files listed in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md, which keep their own licences
(ENet: MIT-style; Vulkan headers: Apache-2.0 / MIT; Steam Audio headers:
Apache-2.0; SDL2 and zlib headers: zlib licence).

This is an altered version of the Sauerbraten source code; it is not the
original software. The original Sauerbraten licence and notes are kept in
src/readme_source.txt.

Sauerbraten game media (maps, textures, models, sounds, and the images in
data/) are NOT covered by this licence; they keep their authors' licences
(see the Sauerbraten distribution and data/license.txt).

NVIDIA DLSS/NGX and NRD are not part of this repository. They are fetched
separately and remain under the NVIDIA RTX SDKs licence.
